1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,252
Pronouns and distributives.

2
00:00:02,252 --> 00:00:18,281
Always singular: each, every, either, neither, one, everyone, someone, anybody, nobody, nothing, many a, and more than one, even though its meaning is plural: more than one house was damaged.

3
00:00:18,281 --> 00:00:23,684
Always plural: both, few, a few, many, several, others.

4
00:00:23,684 --> 00:00:33,645
And some words depend on the noun after of: some, all, most, half, none, a lot, the rest, fractions and percentages.

